    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú adoorí gaa ló'wa xu'utís adór qoomaadár alhhe'eesaay binda hardát, muu ir deér oo haratlintaao ga máw. Inooín qeeremaá al/agiimá' kin iiárií qamín, nee intsaahhasár neetlaame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intsaahhasarí amór i dahh a amór mukduú lamuuse. Afoodá' hho' ar baraá muner'ín aa hhitirút adór gár taa daá/ ar muqslír da/a/aam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí in intsaahhatimis iwa kaahi, «Duuxo ka tlaakw.» Slám ta kaahi, «Muruú /aymarka ku tlaákw /aymaaro.» Ala Mungú muruú /ayma sleémeero guna tleéhh as kuwa /ayi ar sluufaay nee mukdá' aa haratlintii', kudá' looeema gaa tsaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma umuúqo gaaro ar Mungú aa tleéhh ka hhoo'. Slám ar si'imá wa hariim i káhh. Ala umuúqo gaaro gár kawa hariím masók a kan ilaoh ar sluufaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma axweesantá Mungú nee firo muruuwí sleémeero ngwa hhoohhooeesiyé' dír geeraá Munguhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intsaahhatisarí sleémeero alki/iiteek dír hhae. Daqaní kuúng a sagadiyusmoó hhoó' tleehhít oo Kristo Yesu. Asma kuúng qeeruuwók un /aymís axweesantá haratlintaaooro nee intsaahhasadár ló', tidá' kuúng taa eehát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng ti harmagahh nee tiitadár slasla/aren, tiitadá' amami'i, tidá' hariimaaká alki/ituuwo. Kuúng intsahhaám Mungú kuwa ilaiwawa/ baraá slafiingoge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma slaqwa iwa intsahhaan neetoro as /uuru nguwa sleer, a gár qoom. Ala qeeru iwa intsahhan ilaiwa/amér Munguhe, an ak gár hhoo' kángw kilá' wa ale. Asma adoorí bara tléhh, al'axweesantá slafingwí i deer, nee ar slafingwdá' aluú wa hardáh sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí oo ló', oo hariím haratlintaaooro, slám i ló'wa harín ya/aamaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an gár atén tas daawimiitaan nee tas ló'wa gadiyuusaan, asma haraxu'utirén aga qaasaán gawaá Munguúdá' slaáf. Inós a Ba/amusmoó muu sleémeero, ak alé oo mukdá' gwa haratlintii'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí hara'ayiimeek nee intsaahhatimiseek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee masoombi'iimarók mingiwa waaqaá', ala kuúng na slaqsaay tleehhiít dír mukdá' aa haratlintii'i ar baraá axweesanaywók nee baraá tlehhemi'iiwók nee slám ar baraá sla'aari nee haratlintaao nee hhohhoaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarí án niwa hardihiiká, ilakaaharu tleehheek oo muu kuwa axweesantá Mungú i soomus, nee kuwa naanaq, nee kuwa intsaahhatimis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng aleesleemuú Qeeru u koón baraawoge, kudá' taa sleér qoomár aaruuse iwa aaririín nee bariise uwa dákw i qás. Ala aleesleemuusíng mu mawaar kuwa ar gadiyus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí na aldakuuteek nee kuwa tlehhit ar ilakaaharu, as muu ngiwa tsaahhi adór kuúng tar geerií kumit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adór kuúng tar hot ga/aaweek nee muruudá' ta intsaahhatimis ga/aaweek sleeme, kumiít muruuwí sleémeero kuwa tlehhit. Asma adoorí bara tléhh, daqaní kuúng kilók ti ba/amís, nee mukdá' sleémeero kuúng u iiárií qamiím sleeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
